Third-party components redistributed in this repository:

- bpf/include/bpf/*.h
  libbpf BPF helper headers, vendored from https://github.com/libbpf/libbpf
  (v1.5.0). Licensed LGPL-2.1 OR BSD-2-Clause; used here under BSD-2-Clause.

- bpf/vmlinux.h
  Generated from Linux kernel BTF with bpftool. Derived from Linux kernel
  headers (GPL-2.0 WITH Linux-syscall-note); this is a machine-generated type
  description used solely for CO-RE compilation.

Go module dependencies are declared in go.mod and enumerated, with their
licences, in the SBOM published with each release.
